45
00:03:09,100 --> 00:03:10,400
No room for failure.

46
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:12,580
Operation SOP is a go!

47
00:03:16,060 --> 00:03:19,119
He might be able to shoot
a fly mid-air, but not me!

48
00:03:19,260 --> 00:03:20,280
I'm faster!

49
00:03:22,700 --> 00:03:24,640
Dang, Leo's pretty quick!

50
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:26,428
Maybe he can pull this off!

51
00:03:28,220 --> 00:03:31,338
We'll rescue our captured
compatriots no matter what!

52
00:03:32,060 --> 00:03:33,520
Goal! Come on, Leo!

53
00:03:33,820 --> 00:03:34,820
You can do it!

54
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:37,220
Please, let this plan work!

55
00:03:42,300 --> 00:03:43,500
Wait, wait!

56
00:03:44,660 --> 00:03:45,490
Huh?

57
00:03:50,660 --> 00:03:55,131
Isn't it kind of weird that we haven't
had any new workers in nearly a year?

58
00:04:00,300 --> 00:04:03,535
Yeah, I heard they don't even
visit the palace anymore.

59
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:06,887
Who's slacking on the clock?

60
00:04:08,380 --> 00:04:09,580
Not us!

61
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:21,473
You would think when 500 of
you people don't return home,

62
00:04:21,620 --> 00:04:23,738
