63
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:28,740
And yet the Tontadas
don't suspect a thing.

64
00:04:28,960 --> 00:04:30,860
They are so incredibly dumb.

65
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:32,960
I mean, pure-hearted.

66
00:04:35,640 --> 00:04:38,157
So why do you think
they stopped showing up?

67
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:39,070
No clue.

68
00:04:42,100 --> 00:04:44,400
Well, if we can't enslave anymore,

69
00:04:44,640 --> 00:04:47,993
