off the 500 we already have.

70
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:50,160
How about some job now?

71
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:11,340
What gives?

72
00:05:11,660 --> 00:05:14,366
This smile fruit doesn't
look ripe enough yet!

73
00:05:17,260 --> 00:05:18,520
Are you okay?

74
00:05:19,340 --> 00:05:20,400
Start talking.

75
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:23,757
I thought Tontata could grow
anything, so what's with this crap?

76
00:05:23,840 --> 00:05:25,300
We usually can.

77
00:05:25,780 --> 00:05:28,497
These smile fruits aren't
exactly natural, though.

78
00:05:28,580 --> 00:05:29,880
Hey, no excuses!

79
00:05:30,620 --> 00:05:33,914
Could you give my brother a
few minutes to rest, please?

80
00:05:36,220 --> 00:05:38,777
Today's meal was a little
bit spoiled, you see.

81
00:05:38,860 --> 00:05:40,677
Now you're complaining about the food?

82
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:42,348
Want to cure your princess?

83
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:45,220
You know just how sick Mon Cherie is.

84
00:05:46,220 --> 00:05:47,860
Yes, yes we do.

85
00:05:48,100 --> 00:05:50,697
Then get your ass back
to farming more fruit.

86
00:05:50,780 --> 00:05:53,697
You know they're an essential
ingredient in making her medication,

87
00:05:53,780 --> 00:05:54,960
or did you forget?

88
00:05:55,380 --> 00:05:57,977
The number of acceptable
fruits you produce in one

89
00:05:58,060 --> 00:06:00,897
season is less than 10 %
of what you're harvesting.

90
00:06:00,980 --> 00:06:03,097
You need to find a way to
increase your productivity.

91
00:06:03,180 --> 00:06:06,180
Do you think we could
see Princess Moncheree?

92
00:06:08,740 --> 00:06:09,680
No way.

93
00:06:09,940 --> 00:06:11,020
Why not, though?

94
00:06:12,460 --> 00:06:17,100
Because if you were to contract her
illness, we would be devastated. Huh?

95
00:06:17,620 --> 00:06:20,357
We would never forgive
ourselves if we allowed anything

96
00:06:20,440 --> 00:06:23,440
terrible to happen to our
beloved Tuntada partners.

97
00:06:28,780 --> 00:06:30,340
Aw, Mr. Underling.

98
00:06:31,320 --> 00:06:34,177
We're going to push ourselves
to work even harder.

99
00:06:34,260 --> 00:06:37,201
Please continue to take
good care of our princess.

100
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:38,430
All right.

101
00:06:39,940 --> 00:06:42,920
They're so gullible, I almost feel bad.

102
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:45,580
Why, Robaland?

103
00:06:45,900 --> 00:06:48,100
Why stop me? I'm sorry.

104
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:52,899
However, if I hadn't done something,
then you would have gotten hurt.

105
00:06:53,020 --> 00:06:53,850
Huh?

106
00:06:53,933 --> 00:06:55,400
That fly he sniped?

107
00:06:57,980 --> 00:07:01,400
He somehow shot it right between the eyes.

108
00:07:02,900 --> 00:07:04,837
Treble's vision must be exceptional.

109
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:06,417
And his aim.

110
00:07:06,500 --> 00:07:10,017
I believe it's far too
dangerous to approach Sugar.

111
00:07:10,100 --> 00:07:11,806
While he's watching over her.

112
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:16,980
So, you got anything for a plan B?

113
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:21,800
That goes there

114
00:07:25,660 --> 00:07:27,484
Hey, what's up with this cargo?

115
00:07:27,860 --> 00:07:29,520
It's a swarm of pink ornets!

116
00:07:34,780 --> 00:07:36,537
I have an urgent report from Mr.

117
00:07:36,620 --> 00:07:37,450
Trouble.

118
00:07:38,940 --> 00:07:40,420
Sir, we have a problem.

119
00:07:40,860 --> 00:07:44,389
Captain Eve's pirates are causing
a disturbance in Sector 4.

120
00:07:44,540 --> 00:07:48,893
They are demanding to speak to an
executive about renegotiating the price.

121
00:07:50,220 --> 00:07:53,937
Hmm, they think they don't have
to be afraid of Joker anymore.

122
00:07:54,020 --> 00:07:55,837
That takes some nerve!

123
00:07:55,920 --> 00:08:02,157
Hey, you're not the regular messenger,

124
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:03,070
are you?

125
00:08:05,660 --> 00:08:07,357
He's on a lunch break right now.

126
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:08,957
That's all—it's an emergency.

127
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:10,977
There's already been a few.

128
00:08:11,060 --> 00:08:12,377
