129
00:08:12,460 --> 00:08:13,695
Please, come quickly!

130
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,120
Casualties, huh?

131
00:08:17,540 --> 00:08:18,370
Okay...

132
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,680
Hey! Hey!

133
00:08:26,340 --> 00:08:27,240
Yes, Trouble?

134
00:08:27,440 --> 00:08:28,577
Are you headed somewhere?

135
00:08:28,660 --> 00:08:33,000
Tighten up security at the four doors
to the Executive Tower. Yes, sir!

136
00:08:34,560 --> 00:08:38,780
And if anything goes wrong, do
let me know at once. Yes, sir!

137
00:08:43,900 --> 00:08:46,740
Master Treble, keep up the good work, sir.

138
00:08:47,220 --> 00:08:48,060
Hey, hey.

139
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:52,140
So where is he? Where's
the fight? This way.

140
00:08:57,060 --> 00:08:59,160
I could handle this mess easily.

141
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:01,150
Yeah, right.

142
00:09:01,233 --> 00:09:02,180
I'm staying safe.

143
00:09:02,820 --> 00:09:05,057
But I think I should let you guys do it.

144
00:09:05,140 --> 00:09:07,081
To build up your self-confidence.

145
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:08,270
Confidence.

146
00:09:08,353 --> 00:09:09,183
And don't worry.

147
00:09:09,360 --> 00:09:12,713
If anything goes wrong, I'll
jump in and take over, okay?

148
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:14,609
Well, that's good to know.

149
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:17,110
Huh?

150
00:09:17,193 --> 00:09:18,023
Someone there?

151
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:26,012
We're here on a mission.

152
00:09:26,300 --> 00:09:27,297
Whatever it takes,

153
00:09:27,380 --> 00:09:31,077
we are going to rescue our friends
who are enslaved here in the factory.

154
00:09:31,160 --> 00:09:35,440
But first, we're going to knock
you out cold, sugar! But why?

155
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:40,833
You're so mean, I don't know
anything about your friends.

156
00:09:41,820 --> 00:09:42,780
Really? Truly?

157
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:46,320
Yeah. Aw, it's okay.

158
00:09:46,500 --> 00:09:47,497
You're being fooled!

159
00:09:47,580 --> 00:09:48,410
It's not okay!

160
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:50,400
Oh, close one!

161
00:09:50,540 --> 00:09:52,187
You'll free our friends now!

162
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:55,320
Who brought you up to this?

163
00:09:55,540 --> 00:09:57,257
We've been cheating you for ages,

164
00:09:57,340 --> 00:10:00,340
and you little dimwits
never had so much as a clue.

165
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,300
I was curious.

166
00:10:02,740 --> 00:10:04,757
You used to come to the
palace all the time,

167
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:07,193
but I haven't seen you in the past year.

168
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:10,967
